&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.fabricatedknowledge.com/p/an-interview-with-[person:58]-3e0#details&quot;&gt;Fabrication Knowledge – An Interview with [person:58]&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
